<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - BeautiControl raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - BeautiControl raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers analyst Diana Temple said she raised her rating on BeautiControl Cosmetics Inc to buy from hold because of better than forecast earnings and &quot;some encouraging sales initiatives.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 1-5/8 at 15-3/8.</p>
</text>
